<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Belle says H1 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Belle says H1 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Net income			1,028 vs 438</p>
<p>Note: Full name Belle Corp. The company attributed the higher income to the brisk sales in its 500-hectare resort in the hillside city of Tagaytay.</p>
